      "id": 1,
      "text": "Founded in July 1934 by German Jewish immigrants who received a land plot from the Jewish National Fund, Kiryat Bialik began as a modest settlement.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
