      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kiryat_Bialik"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Museum of the History of Kiryat Bialik, housed in historic Beit Katz, chronicles the town’s journey from 1934 to today.",
